,"/arc-plc/texas/colorado-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows March to April and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025, September to October ran 31% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 163% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 11235 had its driest year in 2011 at 41% of normal.</p>"}
